\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Static correlation heatmap of the return series.}}{42}{figure.caption.22}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Observation coverage window per ticker. All assets share an identical aligned date range after the ETH-USD availability cutoff in November 2017.}}{43}{figure.caption.24}%
