\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {11}{\ignorespaces Distribution of the 30-day rolling correlation before and after Fisher-z transformation for the Bitcoin--S\&P~500 pair. The transformation improves normality and removes boundary compression.}}{45}{figure.caption.26}%
